## Review checklist

- [ ] Screen ID new or unchanged; registry row updated
- [ ] `UiScreenIds` + widget `screenId` binding present
- [ ] Layout wireframe complete; composites linked not duplicated
- [ ] All triggers and user actions documented
- [ ] Variants table includes suffix letters where needed
- [ ] Widgetbook section matches catalog
- [ ] ACs are Given–When–Then and test-targetable
